> Back to my game. My Valkyrie is on level 47 in Gehennom with a +5 Mjollnir,
> +5 Vorpal Blade, 4 amulets of life saving, AC -26 blah blah blah...

Don't get too cocky.  In just under 45 minutes, my 449 hp Valrykie with
a +6 Vorpal Blade and five (5) amulets of life saving died, in an
incredible string of bad luck involving gremlins stealing intrinsics,
nymphs stealing shields of reflection, wands of death, lack of fire
resistance, fainting, three Wizards of Yendor, tons of dragons and
whatnot, a cursed pick axe, lava, holy wrath and rank stupidity.  It is
a tale of sorrow truly worthy of the bards.  Oh but for the lack of one
crummy candle...

That was the first game I'd ever played with a valkyrie.  After one that
powerful (with no cheating, either), I'm not going to play them again
for a while.  I've got a barbarian going pretty good now.

